  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhancing EHRC&apos;s Capacity to Support the Implementation of a Human Rights-Compliant Transitional Justice Process</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: black;&quot;&gt;The main objective of the action is to implement a transparent, accountable, inclusive, participatory, victim-centered and human rights compliant transitional justice process in Ethiopia. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: black;&quot;&gt;This will be fulfilled through three key outcomes: (1) The EHRC and other institutions with TJ related mandate are capacitated to deliver on their TJ mandates; (2) CSOs, VLOs and relevant stakeholders possess the knowledge, capacity and platforms to participate in and influence TJ processes; and (3) The EHRC is conducting monitoring, investigation and documentation of human rights violations and engaging in advocacy and awareness raising on a human rights compliant TJ.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
